      "text": "用单机玩法模拟中式网游氪金压制，但充值不消耗现实金钱",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "This game aims to restore the Chinese style of online games where players can recharge without spending real money, and let players experience the fun of \"kelao\"!(This is a single player game.)",
