    {
      "text": "10 多个结局由疯狂氪金称霸或稳健发展恋爱等路线决定",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "There are about 10+ different endings for different experiences! Do you want to recharge like crazy and become the lord of the Imperial City? Or do you want to develop steadily and get a beautiful woman? It's your choice!",
